Form block (volto-form-block): every form gets a cleaner Juizi look (box, bordered fields, clearer messages, Juizi-shaped buttons, side gutter), themeable with --juizi-form-* tokens. The extension adds text beside the form, labels above the fields, the site's button styles for Send and Cancel, a background, and top and bottom padding, with the same text fields as the donation and membership sign-up blocks. volto-juizi-blocks must be listed after volto-form-block. @karel
